                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Whether you're a Republican or Democrat, the soaring cost of health care impacts everyone.\n\nRepublicans need to join us to extend the ACA tax credits that help bring down premium costs before it's too late. The President\u2019s own pollsters have underscored the political urgency.",
